{"slug":"washoku-note","name":"Washoku Note","zh":"和食ノート","tag":"Japanese home-cooking notebook: grid-paper background, taped recipe notes, side index tabs, a miso-soup builder and a month-by-month seasonal ingredient picker.","colors":{"primary":"#3f5a3a","secondary":"#a3b18a","text":"#2e2a25","accent":"#e0763a","surface":"#fbf8ef","border":"#d9d3c0"},"fonts":{"head":"Klee One","body":"Zen Maru Gothic"},"tok":{"hlh":"1.25","hw":"600","hcase":"none","hls":".03em","h1":"76px","h2":"40px","h3":"24px","pad":"72px","ew":"500","stat":"var(--c-accent)","radius":"4px"},"types":["blog","company"],"ind":["culinary","restaurant"],"styles":["japanese","handdrawn","organic"],"license":"库内自有","format":"fragments","pagelist":[{"slug":"home","label":"Home","group":"Notes"},{"slug":"recipes","label":"Recipes","group":"Notes"},{"slug":"recipe","label":"Recipe: Teriyaki chicken","group":"Notes"},{"slug":"soup","label":"Miso soup builder","group":"Notes"},{"slug":"basics","label":"Basics: dashi & rice","group":"Notes"},{"slug":"seasonal","label":"Seasonal ingredients","group":"Notes"},{"slug":"about","label":"About the notebook","group":"Kitchen"},{"slug":"faq","label":"FAQ","group":"Kitchen"},{"slug":"privacy","label":"Privacy policy","group":"Utility"},{"slug":"404","label":"404 error","group":"Utility"}],"nav":"<style>\n/* Washoku Note — Japanese home-cooking notebook, tokens only */\nbody{background-color:var(--c-surface);background-image:linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-secondary) 28%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-secondary) 28%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:28px 28px}\n.wn-head{padding:clamp(16px,2.4vw,28px) clamp(16px,4vw,56px) 0;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}\n.wn-logo{text-decoration:none;color:var(--c-primary);display:block}\n.wn-logo b{display:block;font:600 clamp(26px,3vw,36px)/1.1 var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em}\n.wn-logo small{font:500 12px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.24em;color:var(--c-secondary);text-transform:uppercase}\n.wn-tabs{position:fixed;right:0;top:140px;z-index:40;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;list-style:none}\n.wn-tabs a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px;padding:0 14px 0 12px;background:var(--c-surface);border:2px solid var(--c-primary);border-right:0;border-radius:12px 0 0 12px;text-decoration:none;font:500 14px var(--f-head);color:var(--c-primary);writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-orientation:mixed;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:14px 10px;min-height:96px;transition:transform .2s,background .2s;transform:translateX(8px)}\n.wn-tabs a:hover{transform:translateX(0);background:var(--c-accent);color:var(--on-accent)}\n.wn-tabs li:nth-child(2) a{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-secondary) 50%,var(--c-surface))}.wn-tabs li:nth-child(4) a{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-accent) 35%,var(--c-surface))}\n.wn-tabs .more{position:relative}\n.wn-tabs .dd{position:absolute;right:100%;top:0;display:none;min-width:240px;padding:18px 22px;background:var(--c-surface);border:2px solid var(--c-primary);writing-mode:horizontal-tb;margin-right:6px}\n.wn-tabs .more:hover .dd,.wn-tabs .more:focus-within .dd{display:grid}\n.wn-tabs .dd h4{font:700 11px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c-accent);margin:8px 0 4px}\n.wn-tabs .dd a{writing-mode:horizontal-tb;display:block;min-height:0;border:0;padding:5px 0;background:none;transform:none;font:500 14px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:0;color:var(--c-text)}\n.wn-m{display:none}\n.wn-m summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:2px solid var(--c-primary);border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:700 12px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.14em;background:var(--c-surface)}\n.wn-m summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.wn-m nav{position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;top:100%;background:var(--c-surface);border:2px solid var(--c-primary);border-radius:14px;padding:8px 18px;display:grid;z-index:50}\n.wn-m nav a{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--c-border);text-decoration:none;font:500 15px var(--f-body);min-height:44px}\n@media(max-width:900px){.wn-tabs{display:none}.wn-m{display:block;position:relative}}\n.wn-main{padding:0 clamp(16px,6vw,110px)}\n.wn-sec{padding:clamp(28px,4vw,60px) 0}\n.wn-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,70px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(28px,5vw,70px) 0}\n.wn-hero h1{font:600 clamp(40px,6vw,var(--h1))/1.2 var(--f-head);color:var(--c-primary);letter-spacing:.02em}\n.wn-hero h1 u{text-decoration:none;background:linear-gradient(transparent 65%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-accent) 45%,transparent) 65% 92%,transparent 92%)}\n.wn-hero p{font:500 17px/1.9 var(--f-body);max-width:42ch;margin:18px 0 24px}\n@media(max-width:860px){.wn-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.wn-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:50px;padding:0 26px;background:var(--c-primary);color:var(--on-primary);border:2px solid var(--c-primary);text-decoration:none;font:600 15px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.06em;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--c-accent)}\n.wn-btn:hover{transform:translate(1px,1px);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--c-accent)}\n.wn-btn.o{background:var(--c-surface);color:var(--c-primary)}\n.wn-note{position:relative;background:#fff;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-surface) 25%,#fff);border:2px solid var(--c-primary);border-radius:4px;padding:clamp(20px,2.6vw,34px);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-primary) 18%,transparent)}\n.wn-note::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:-14px;left:50%;width:96px;height:28px;margin-left:-48px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-accent) 55%,transparent);transform:rotate(-2deg);border-left:2px dotted color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-primary) 30%,transparent);border-right:2px dotted color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-primary) 30%,transparent)}\n.wn-note.r::before{transform:rotate(3deg);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-secondary) 70%,transparent)}\n.wn-note h3{font:600 24px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--c-primary);margin-bottom:6px}\n.wn-note .jp{font:500 13px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--c-accent)}\n.wn-hd{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:0 0 26px}\n.wn-hd h2{font:600 clamp(24px,3vw,var(--h2)) var(--f-head);color:var(--c-primary);letter-spacing:.04em;background:linear-gradient(transparent 70%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-secondary) 45%,transparent) 70%);padding:0 6px}\n.wn-hd span{font:500 12px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.24em;color:var(--c-secondary);text-transform:uppercase}\n.wn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(20px,3vw,40px) clamp(16px,2vw,30px)}\n.wn-card{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}\n.wn-card:nth-child(2n){transform:rotate(.7deg)}.wn-card:nth-child(3n){transform:rotate(-.6deg)}\n.wn-card .ph{aspect-ratio:4/3;border:2px solid var(--c-primary);background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-secondary) 30%,var(--c-surface)) 0 10px,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-secondary) 14%,var(--c-surface)) 10px 20px);margin-bottom:12px;position:relative}\n.wn-card .ph::after{content:\"缺图\";position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:6px;font:600 10px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.14em}\n.wn-card .m{font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary);display:flex;gap:12px}\n@media(max-width:860px){.wn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.wn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n\n/* builder */\n.wn-build{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr minmax(260px,420px);gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:start}\n@media(max-width:900px){.wn-build{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.wn-step{margin-bottom:26px}\n.wn-step h3{font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}\n.wn-step h3 i{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c-accent);color:var(--on-accent);font:600 16px var(--f-head);font-style:normal}\n.wn-opts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.wn-opts button{min-height:46px;padding:0 18px;border:2px solid var(--c-primary);border-radius:999px;background:var(--c-surface);color:var(--c-primary);font:500 15px var(--f-body);cursor:pointer}\n.wn-opts button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--c-primary);color:var(--on-primary)}\n.wn-bowl{position:sticky;top:20px}\n.wn-bowl h3{font:600 26px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:12px}\n.wn-bowl ul{list-style:none}.wn-bowl li{padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--c-secondary);font:500 15px var(--f-body);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}\n.wn-bowl .t{font:600 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-accent);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:14px}\n.wn-bowl p{font:500 15px/1.8 var(--f-body);margin-top:10px}\n@media(max-width:900px){.wn-bowl{position:static}}\n.wn-months{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:26px}\n.wn-months button{min-height:48px;border:2px solid var(--c-primary);background:var(--c-surface);font:600 15px var(--f-head);cursor:pointer;color:var(--c-primary);border-radius:6px}\n.wn-months button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--c-accent);color:var(--on-accent)}\n@media(max-width:600px){.wn-months{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}\n.wn-ing{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0 clamp(20px,4vw,50px);list-style:none}\n.wn-ing li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--c-secondary);font:500 15px var(--f-body)}\n.wn-ing li b{font-weight:600}\n.wn-steps{counter-reset:s;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:18px}\n.wn-steps li{counter-increment:s;display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:14px}\n.wn-steps li::before{content:counter(s);display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:2px solid var(--c-primary);border-radius:50%;font:600 20px var(--f-head);background:var(--c-surface)}\n.wn-steps p{font:500 16px/1.9 var(--f-body)}\n.wn-two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,70px);align-items:start}\n@media(max-width:860px){.wn-two{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.wn-foot{margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,90px);border-top:2px solid var(--c-primary);padding:clamp(30px,4vw,56px) clamp(16px,6vw,110px) 22px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-surface) 85%,#fff)}\n.wn-foot .top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 2fr;gap:clamp(24px,6vw,90px)}\n.wn-foot .big{font:600 28px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.wn-foot h4{font:700 11px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c-accent);margin-bottom:8px}\n.wn-foot ul{list-style:none}.wn-foot li a{display:inline-block;padding:6px 0;text-decoration:none;font:500 14px var(--f-body);min-height:32px}\n.wn-foot .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}\n.wn-foot .copy{margin-top:24px;font:500 12px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)}\n@media(max-width:800px){.wn-foot .top{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\nhtml,body{overflow-x:clip}img,svg{max-width:100%}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.wn-tabs a,.wn-btn{transition:none}}\n</style><header class=\"wn-head\"><a class=\"wn-logo\" href=\"{{p:home}}\"><b>和食ノート</b><small>Washoku Note · Japanese home cooking</small></a><details class=\"wn-m\"><summary>MENU</summary><nav><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><a href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">Recipes</a><a href=\"{{p:recipe}}\">Recipe: Teriyaki chicken</a><a href=\"{{p:soup}}\">Miso soup builder</a><a href=\"{{p:basics}}\">Basics: dashi & rice</a><a href=\"{{p:seasonal}}\">Seasonal ingredients</a><a href=\"{{p:about}}\">About the notebook</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></nav></details></header><ul class=\"wn-tabs\"><li><a href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">レシピ</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:soup}}\">味噌汁</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:seasonal}}\">旬</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:basics}}\">基本</a></li><li class=\"more\"><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">他</a><div class=\"dd\"><h4>Notes</h4><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><a href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">Recipes</a><a href=\"{{p:recipe}}\">Recipe: Teriyaki chicken</a><a href=\"{{p:soup}}\">Miso soup builder</a><a href=\"{{p:basics}}\">Basics: dashi & rice</a><a href=\"{{p:seasonal}}\">Seasonal ingredients</a><h4>Kitchen</h4><a href=\"{{p:about}}\">About the notebook</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a><h4>Utility</h4><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></div></li></ul><div class=\"wn-main\">","foot":"</div><footer class=\"wn-foot\"><div class=\"top\"><div><div class=\"big\">和食ノート</div><p style=\"margin-top:8px;font:500 14px/1.9 var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary);max-width:34ch\">Small, everyday Japanese recipes, written in the margins of a notebook. Template demo content.</p></div><div class=\"cols\"><div><h4>Notes</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">Recipes</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:recipe}}\">Recipe: Teriyaki chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:soup}}\">Miso soup builder</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:basics}}\">Basics: dashi & rice</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:seasonal}}\">Seasonal ingredients</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Kitchen</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:about}}\">About the notebook</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Utility</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"copy\">© 2026 Washoku Note</div></footer>","pages":{"home":"<section class=\"wn-hero\"><div><span style=\"font:500 12px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.3em;color:var(--c-secondary);text-transform:uppercase\">Japanese home cooking</span><h1 style=\"margin-top:14px\">今日の<u>ごはん</u>、<br>ノートから。</h1><p>Small, everyday recipes written in a notebook: how long, how much, and what to do if it goes wrong. No special equipment.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0\"><a class=\"wn-btn\" href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">レシピを見る</a><a class=\"wn-btn o\" href=\"{{p:soup}}\">味噌汁をつくる</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"wn-note\"><span class=\"jp\">今日のメモ</span><h3>Salt the rice water.</h3><p style=\"font:500 15px/1.9 var(--f-body)\">A pinch in the cooking water seasons onigiri from the inside. About 1 g per 300 g of rice.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-hd\"><h2>最近のレシピ</h2><span>Recent</span></div><div class=\"wn-grid\"><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">照り焼きチキン</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Teriyaki chicken</span><div class=\"m\"><span>20 min</span><span>Main</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">肉じゃが</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Nikujaga</span><div class=\"m\"><span>40 min</span><span>Simmered</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">卵焼き</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Tamagoyaki</span><div class=\"m\"><span>10 min</span><span>Egg</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">味噌汁</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Miso soup</span><div class=\"m\"><span>10 min</span><span>Soup</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">おにぎり</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Onigiri</span><div class=\"m\"><span>15 min</span><span>Rice</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">ほうれん草のおひたし</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Spinach ohitashi</span><div class=\"m\"><span>8 min</span><span>Side</span></div></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-two\"><div class=\"wn-note r\"><span class=\"jp\">味噌汁ビルダー</span><h3>Build a miso soup.</h3><p style=\"font:500 15px/1.9 var(--f-body)\">Pick a dashi, a miso and two or three ingredients. We tell you the order and the timing.</p><p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a class=\"wn-btn\" href=\"{{p:soup}}\">つくる</a></p></div><div class=\"wn-note\"><span class=\"jp\">旬のもの</span><h3>What's in season?</h3><p style=\"font:500 15px/1.9 var(--f-body)\">Twelve months of vegetables, fish and fruit, and the simple dishes that suit them.</p><p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a class=\"wn-btn o\" href=\"{{p:seasonal}}\">月ごとに見る</a></p></div></div></section>","recipes":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Recipes</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:600\">レシピ一覧</h1><p class=\"lead\">Six everyday dishes, with timings you can trust.</p></div></section><section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-grid\"><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">照り焼きチキン</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Teriyaki chicken</span><div class=\"m\"><span>20 min</span><span>Main</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">肉じゃが</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Nikujaga</span><div class=\"m\"><span>40 min</span><span>Simmered</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">卵焼き</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Tamagoyaki</span><div class=\"m\"><span>10 min</span><span>Egg</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">味噌汁</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Miso soup</span><div class=\"m\"><span>10 min</span><span>Soup</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">おにぎり</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Onigiri</span><div class=\"m\"><span>15 min</span><span>Rice</span></div></a><a class=\"wn-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\"></div><h3 style=\"font:600 20px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.04em\">ほうれん草のおひたし</h3><span class=\"jp\" style=\"font:500 13px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">Spinach ohitashi</span><div class=\"m\"><span>8 min</span><span>Side</span></div></a></div></section>","recipe":"<section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-hd\"><h1 style=\"font:600 clamp(32px,4.4vw,56px)/1.15 var(--f-head);color:var(--c-primary)\">照り焼きチキン</h1><span>Teriyaki chicken</span></div>\n<div class=\"wn-two\"><div class=\"wn-note\"><h3>材料 · Serves 2</h3><ul class=\"wn-ing\"><li><span>Chicken thigh</span><b>2 pieces</b></li><li><span>Soy sauce</span><b>2 tbsp</b></li><li><span>Mirin</span><b>2 tbsp</b></li><li><span>Sake</span><b>1 tbsp</b></li><li><span>Sugar</span><b>1 tsp</b></li><li><span>Oil</span><b>1 tsp</b></li></ul></div>\n<div><ol class=\"wn-steps\"><li><p>Pat the thighs dry and prick the skin with a fork. This helps the sauce cling.</p></li><li><p>Pan-fry skin-side down over medium heat for 6 minutes without moving, until deep golden.</p></li><li><p>Flip, cover and cook 4 minutes. Wipe out the excess fat with kitchen paper.</p></li><li><p>Add the sauce and let it reduce, spooning it over until glossy. Slice and serve over rice.</p></li></ol></div></div></section>","soup":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Miso soup builder</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:600\">味噌汁ビルダー</h1><p class=\"lead\">Pick dashi, miso and ingredients. We'll give you the order.</p></div></section><section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-build\"><div><div class=\"wn-step\"><h3><i>1</i>Dashi</h3><div class=\"wn-opts\" data-g=\"base\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Kombu dashi</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Katsuobushi dashi</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Niboshi dashi</button></div></div><div class=\"wn-step\"><h3><i>2</i>Miso</h3><div class=\"wn-opts\" data-g=\"miso\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">White (shiro)</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Red (aka)</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Mixed (awase)</button></div></div><div class=\"wn-step\"><h3><i>3</i>Two or three ingredients</h3><div class=\"wn-opts\" data-g=\"veg\" data-multi=\"1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Tofu</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Wakame</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Daikon</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Potato</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Spring onion</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Mushroom</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Aburaage</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Clams</button></div></div></div><aside class=\"wn-note r wn-bowl\"><h3>Your bowl</h3><ul id=\"wn-list\"></ul><div class=\"t\" id=\"wn-t\"></div><p id=\"wn-p\"></p></aside></div></section><script>(function(){var g=document.querySelectorAll(\".wn-opts\");if(!g.length||!document.getElementById(\"wn-list\"))return;var T={\"Tofu\":2,\"Wakame\":2,\"Daikon\":6,\"Potato\":8,\"Spring onion\":1,\"Mushroom\":4,\"Aburaage\":2,\"Clams\":5};function sel(grp){return[].slice.call(document.querySelector('[data-g=\"'+grp+'\"]').querySelectorAll(\"button\")).filter(function(b){return b.getAttribute(\"aria-pressed\")===\"true\"}).map(function(b){return b.textContent})}function r(){var b=sel(\"base\")[0]||\"Kombu dashi\",m=sel(\"miso\")[0]||\"Mixed (awase)\",v=sel(\"veg\"),t=5+v.reduce(function(a,x){return Math.max(a,T[x]||0)},0);document.getElementById(\"wn-list\").innerHTML=\"<li><span>Dashi</span><b>\"+b+\" · 400 ml</b></li><li><span>Miso</span><b>\"+m+\" · 1½ tbsp</b></li>\"+v.map(function(x){return\"<li><span>\"+x+\"</span><b>\"+(T[x]>4?\"simmer first\":\"add last\")+\"</b></li>\"}).join(\"\");document.getElementById(\"wn-t\").textContent=\"ABOUT \"+t+\" MIN\";document.getElementById(\"wn-p\").textContent=v.length>3?\"That is a lot. Try keeping it to three so each one tastes like itself.\":\"Heat the dashi, simmer hard vegetables, then lower the heat and dissolve the miso through a sieve. Do not let it boil after the miso goes in.\"}g.forEach(function(el){el.querySelectorAll(\"button\").forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){if(el.dataset.multi){b.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\",b.getAttribute(\"aria-pressed\")!==\"true\")}else{el.querySelectorAll(\"button\").forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\",x===b)})}r()}})});r()})();</script>","basics":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Basics</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:600\">基本の基本</h1><p class=\"lead\">Two things to get right before anything else.</p></div></section><section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-two\"><div class=\"wn-note\"><span class=\"jp\">出汁</span><h3>Dashi in 20 minutes</h3><ol class=\"wn-steps\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li><p>Soak 10 g kombu in 1 litre water for 15 minutes.</p></li><li><p>Heat gently; remove kombu just before boiling.</p></li><li><p>Add 20 g katsuobushi, turn off, wait 2 minutes and strain.</p></li></ol></div><div class=\"wn-note r\"><span class=\"jp\">ご飯</span><h3>Rice, the Japanese way</h3><ol class=\"wn-steps\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li><p>Rinse until the water is nearly clear.</p></li><li><p>Soak 30 minutes. Use 1:1.1 rice to water.</p></li><li><p>Cook, then rest covered for 10 minutes.</p></li></ol></div></div></section>","seasonal":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Seasonal ingredients</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:600\">旬の食材</h1><p class=\"lead\">Choose a month.</p></div></section><section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-months\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Month\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">1月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">2月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">3月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">4月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">5月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">6月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">7月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">8月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">9月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">10月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">11月</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">12月</button></div><div class=\"wn-note\" id=\"wn-sea\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></section><script>(function(){var S={\"0\": [\"Daikon · Napa cabbage · Yuzu\", \"Warming nabe and simple pickles.\"], \"1\": [\"Komatsuna · Mikan · Cod\", \"Hot pots and steamed greens.\"], \"2\": [\"Bamboo shoot · Spring cabbage · Clams\", \"Takikomi gohan and clear soups.\"], \"3\": [\"Asparagus · Sakura shrimp · Peas\", \"Light tempura and rice dishes.\"], \"4\": [\"New onion · Bonito · Broad beans\", \"Seared katsuo and salads.\"], \"5\": [\"Ume · Cucumber · Aji\", \"Pickling season; ume syrup.\"], \"6\": [\"Eggplant · Edamame · Tomato\", \"Chilled noodles and grilled vegetables.\"], \"7\": [\"Corn · Okra · Peach\", \"Cold somen, corn rice.\"], \"8\": [\"Sanma · Chestnut · Pears\", \"Grilled sanma, kuri gohan.\"], \"9\": [\"Matsutake · Sweet potato · Kabocha\", \"Mushroom rice, simmered pumpkin.\"], \"10\": [\"Daikon · Spinach · Persimmon\", \"Oden, nikujaga.\"], \"11\": [\"Yuzu · Leek · Buri\", \"Toshikoshi soba, yuzu bath.\"]},b=document.querySelectorAll(\".wn-months button\"),o=document.getElementById(\"wn-sea\");if(!b.length)return;function p(i){b.forEach(function(x,j){x.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\",j===i)});var s=S[i];o.innerHTML=\"<h3>\"+(i+1)+\"月 の旬</h3><p class=jp>IN SEASON</p><p style=\\\"font:600 22px/1.5 var(--f-head);margin:10px 0\\\">\"+s[0]+\"</p><p style=\\\"font:500 16px/1.8 var(--f-body)\\\">\"+s[1]+\"</p>\"}b.forEach(function(x,i){x.onclick=function(){p(i)}});p(new Date().getMonth())})();</script>","about":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>About the notebook</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:600\">このノートについて</h1></div></section><section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"wn-note\" style=\"max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font:500 17px/2 var(--f-body)\">Washoku Note started as margins in a cookbook: the changes I made every time. Replace this with your own story, your family and your kitchen.</p></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:600\">FAQ</h1></div></section><section class=\"wn-sec\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Can I use instant dashi?</summary><p>Yes. Use half the amount first and taste.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I buy mirin?</summary><p>Most supermarkets. Look for hon-mirin, not \"seasoning\".</p></details><details><summary>Is sake necessary?</summary><p>It softens the smell of chicken. Water with a squeeze of lemon is a stand-in.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"wn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"wn-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(50px,9vw,120px)\"><div class=\"wn-note\" style=\"max-width:520px;margin:0 auto\"><span class=\"jp\">404</span><h1 style=\"font:600 clamp(36px,6vw,64px) var(--f-head);margin:10px 0\">ページがありません</h1><p style=\"font:500 16px/1.9 var(--f-body);margin-bottom:20px\">This page was torn out of the notebook.</p><a class=\"wn-btn\" href=\"{{p:home}}\">ノートへ戻る</a></div></section>"}}